Case 3: nested SP call as 1st arg of 3-arg function     

===================================================
add_three(add_two(1, 2), 3, 4)    
10     

===================================================
    
Case 4: nested SP call as middle arg of 3-arg function     

===================================================
add_three(1, add_two(2, 3), 4)    
10     

===================================================
    
Case 5: nested SP call as last arg of 3-arg function     

===================================================
add_three(1, 2, add_two(3, 4))    
10     

